  description="Retina specialist in Tijuana, Mexico: diabetic retinopathy, retinal detachment, intravitreal injections and vitrectomy with Dr. Juvenal Guzmán, fellowship‑trained in retina and vitreous."
  eyebrow="Dr. Juvenal Guzmán · Retina & vitreous"
  h1="Retina specialist in Tijuana, minutes from San Diego"
  lede="Diabetic retinopathy, retinal detachment, macular degeneration, intravitreal injections and vitrectomy with an ophthalmic surgeon fellowship‑trained in retina at the Mexican Institute of Ophthalmology (UNAM)."
  photo="dr-juvenal-guzman-imagen-retina"
  photoAlt="Dr. Juvenal Guzmán reviewing a retinal image in Tijuana"
  es="/profesionales-de-la-salud/retinologo-dr-juvenal-guzman-cerda/"
  en="/en/retina-specialist-tijuana/"
  tag="EN · Retina"
  frente="retina"
  setmore={doctors.juvenal.setmore}
  image="/og/retinologo-tijuana.jpg"
  procedure="Vitrectomy and intravitreal injection"
